    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Ordo Xenos, Alien Hunters",
    "summary": "When your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, you can activate a Mission Tactic you have yet to use this battle. Each option affects all your **DEATHWATCH** units, and ends as your following [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts. Under **Furor Tactics**, their weapons gain **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**. Under **Malleus Tactics**, their weapons gain **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**. Under **Purgatus Tactics**, a [Critical Wound](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks) from an attacking **DEATHWATCH** model in your army gives **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)** to that attack.",
